            'Three tiles each; arrange into top and bottom hand',
            'Scoring as Baccarat or Pai Gow: total each hand, drop tens digit; nine high, zero low',
            'If top outranks bottom by mistake, dealer may turn tiles 180 degrees',
            'Banker wins when both hands tie',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        strategy: {
          basic: 'Choose arrangement so top and bottom hands are each as strong as possible; avoid the worst arrangement that can be beaten by both others.',
          intermediate: 'Eight ways to play each hand (pairs rotated 180 degrees); decide whether to try for win or push based on odds.',
          advanced: 'Doubles limit possibilities; two or three doubles can be played only one way. House Way is teachable in under ten minutes.',
          tips: [
            'Push percentage is under 22%, lower than Pai Gow; more hands won or lost.',
